1365	{"artifactId":"ISSUE-1fc9e41abd47443f","entry":{"id":"cd65e17d","text":"rootCause CORRECTION (post-build). This record diagnosed the defect as HLD_FORMAT in src/workflow/artifacts/format/formats.ts. That constant is only the FALLBACK: renderHldMarkdown calls resolveDocumentFormat('hld', repoPath) (template-loader.ts:139), which resolves through a three-tier cascade — <repo>/.insrc/artifacts/formats/hld.md, then ~/.insrc/artifacts/formats/hld.md, then the bundled src/assets/artifacts/formats/hld.md — and falls back to the in-code constant ONLY when no template resolves. The LIVE defect was the missing `ux` section in the BUNDLED TEMPLATE, which this record never names. Confirmed empirically during the build: editing formats.ts and hld.ts alone left the new test red with no UX section rendered; only adding the template section turned it green. The shipped fix covers both so constant and template stay parallel. Future readers: for any FORMAT-section defect, start at src/assets/artifacts/formats/<kind>.md, not formats.ts.","actor":{"id":"legacy:code-review-cr-1fc9e41abd47443f-s1-med-adherence","kind":"person","properties":{"name":"code-review (CR-1fc9e41abd47443f-s1, MED/adherence)"}},"timestamp":"2026-10-01T09:06:23.417Z","feedback":[],"kind":"comment","anchor":{"section":"src/workflow/artifacts/format/template-loader.ts","lines":[139,149]}}}
